    "上传": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upload"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上傳"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上传、下载为该连接经隧道的字节数。目标域名来自请求本身或 TLS SNI / HTTP Host，只保存在内存里，断开隧道即清空。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upload and download are the bytes this connection moved through the tunnel. Host names come from the request or the TLS SNI / HTTP Host, are kept in memory only and are cleared when the tunnel stops."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上傳、下載為該連線經隧道的位元組數。目標網域來自請求本身或 TLS SNI / HTTP Host，只儲存在記憶體裡，斷開隧道即清空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次下载失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
