    "下拉更新全部订阅。延迟为经该节点请求 http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204 的 HTTP 真连接时间，5 秒无响应显示超时。连接中切换节点会自动重连。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pull down to update every subscription. Delay is the time of a real HTTP request to http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204 through the node; no answer in 5 seconds shows Timeout. Switching nodes while connected reconnects automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下拉更新全部訂閱。延遲為經該節點請求 http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204 的 HTTP 真連線時間，5 秒無回應顯示逾時。連線中切換節點會自動重連。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
