    "HTTPS 只解密插件 [MITM] 列出的主机，明文 HTTP 全部交给插件处理，仅支持 HTTP/1.1。使用前需要先连上 VPN。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS is decrypted only for hosts listed under a plugin's [MITM]; plain HTTP always goes through plugins. HTTP/1.1 only. Connect the VPN first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 只解密外掛 [MITM] 列出的主機，明文 HTTP 全部交給外掛處理，僅支援 HTTP/1.1。使用前需要先連上 VPN。"
          }
