    "第一次连接时，iOS 会请求添加 VPN 配置。它只用来把流量交给本 App 分流，不收集你的浏览记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first time you connect, iOS asks to add a VPN configuration. It only hands traffic to this app for routing; your browsing is not collected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一次連線時，iOS 會請求新增 VPN 設定。它只用來把流量交給本 App 分流，不收集你的瀏覽記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
