    "统计由隧道每 5 秒读取一次连接列表累计，只记主机名和字节数，保存在本机，保留 7 天。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The tunnel adds up its connection list every 5 seconds. Only host names and byte counts are kept, on this device, for 7 days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "統計由隧道每 5 秒讀取一次連線清單累計，只記主機名和位元組數，儲存在本機，保留 7 天。"
