    "节点「%@」连不上：手机时间快了约 %lld 分钟。请在设置里打开「自动设置」时间后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@” can't connect: this device's clock is about %2$lld minutes fast. Turn on Set Automatically in Settings › General › Date & Time, then retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "節點「%@」連不上：手機時間快了約 %lld 分鐘。請在設定裡開啟「自動設定」時間後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "节点「%@」连不上：手机时间慢了约 %lld 分钟。请在设置里打开「自动设置」时间后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@” can't connect: this device's clock is about %2$lld minutes slow. Turn on Set Automatically in Settings › General › Date & Time, then retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "節點「%@」連不上：手機時間慢了約 %lld 分鐘。請在設定裡開啟「自動設定」時間後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "节点「%@」被服务器拒绝：订阅可能已到期或被重置，也可能是手机时间不准。请更新订阅，或检查时间后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server rejected “%@”: the subscription may have expired or been reset, or this device's clock is off. Update the subscription, or check the time and retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "節點「%@」被伺服器拒絕：訂閱可能已到期或被重設，也可能是手機時間不準。請更新訂閱，或檢查時間後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
