    "推荐分流：国内域名（.cn 和 geosite-cn 列表）直连阿里 DNS，其余经代理用 Cloudflare 解析。默认设置下所有查询经代理发往 1.1.1.1。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommended split: domestic names (.cn and the geosite-cn list) go directly to AliDNS, everything else to Cloudflare through the proxy. By default every query goes to 1.1.1.1 through the proxy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推薦分流：國內網域（.cn 和 geosite-cn 清單）直連阿里 DNS，其餘經代理用 Cloudflare 解析。預設設定下所有查詢經代理發往 1.1.1.1。"
