            "value": "Allow AnixOps Net under System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions › Network Extensions, then connect again"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請在“系統設定 › 一般 › 登入項目與延伸功能 › 網路延伸功能”中允許 AnixOps Net，然後再連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "网络扩展将在重启 Mac 后生效": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The network extension takes effect after you restart your Mac"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "網路延伸功能將在重新啟動 Mac 後生效"
