    "我的规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "My Rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我的規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "排在订阅规则前面，从上到下匹配。连接中保存会直接换上新规则，已有连接不断开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matched top to bottom before the subscription's rules. Saving while connected swaps them in without dropping connections."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "排在訂閱規則前面，從上到下比對。連線中儲存會直接換上新規則，現有連線不中斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "规则模式下排在预设前面，从上到下匹配。连接中保存会直接换上新规则，已有连接不断开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In rule mode, matched top to bottom before the preset. Saving while connected swaps them in without dropping connections."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則模式下排在預設前面，從上到下比對。連線中儲存會直接換上新規則，現有連線不中斷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动重连": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reconnect automatically"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動重新連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保持不变": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave as is"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持不變"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "隧道意外退出（崩溃、内存超限、系统更新）后由系统几秒内重新连接。手动断开时会一并关闭，下次连接再打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the tunnel quits unexpectedly (a crash, the memory limit, a system update), the system reconnects within seconds. Disconnecting by hand turns this off until you connect again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道意外結束（當機、記憶體超出上限、系統更新）後由系統在幾秒內重新連線。手動斷開時會一併關閉，下次連線再開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi 名称": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi-Fi name"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi-Fi 名稱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其他 Wi-Fi": {
      "localizations": {
